   118	- P given G = 1 is −0.0014 (report line 32). G alone gives −0.177 of the total −0.178.
   119	- Amendment 3 added the priority phase after the predecessor was "killed". The second test does not support that addition. The title is "Checking Newcomers".
   120	- **Fix (text only).** State it in the abstract.
