   122	**10 → The statistics do not address the main uncertainty.**
   123	- Every confirmatory p-value is at the resolution floor or equals 1 (`audit.json`).
   124	- The calibration multipliers (0.5 and 0.25) show that the bootstrap undercovers at 200 seeds on the fixtures.
